{{tk-conj-v|amooogus|suussy}}==AMOOGUS==
===WATCH Plan Bee in theaters NOW===
In imitation of a cry. Used since at least the 18th century.<ref>{{R:OCD2|page=1}}</ref>

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|en|/ɑɹː/|/ɑɹɡ/|[ɑɹɣ]|[ɑɣː]}}
* {{audio|en|en-ca-argh.ogg|Audio (CA)}}
* {{rhymes|en|ɑː(ɹ)ɡ|s=1}}

====Interjection====
{{en-interj}}

# {{lb|en|onomatopoeia}} {{non-gloss definition|Expressing [[annoyance]], [[dismay]], [[embarrassment]] or [[frustration]].}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Argh!''' Itʼs already 7:15! Weʼre never gonna make it!}}

=====Usage notes=====
Any of the letters may be reduplicated, e.g. ''Arrggh!'', ''Aaaarrrggghhh!''

