===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|argh}}, from {{inh|en|ang|earg||inert; weak; timid; cowardly}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*arg}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*argaz}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|ergh}}, {{m|sco|argh}}, {{m|sco|arch}}, {{m|sco|erf||timid; reluctant; unwilling}}. {{doublet|en|eerie}}.

